        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-23T02:11:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Spirit Island has a dedicated <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span class=\"bbcode-b\">online, mobile-friendly living FAQ</span></a>. It’s specifically geared for “I’m in the middle of this game and have this question?..”. All FAQ entries are tagged, and you can do simple text searches <span class=\"bbcode-i\">(no ANDs or ORs, though you can search on partial words)</span>. The back of the Spirit Island rulebook has both a (shortened) hyperlink and QR Code to the FAQ site, so you shouldn’t need to find this forum post to look stuff up.</p>\n<p>The engine it’s running on (Querki) is in beta, so there may occasionally be bugs - but actual downtime is rare and generally short.</p>\n<p>The FAQ entries are written and edited by me and a couple of awesome &amp; knowledgable volunteers from among the long-time playtesters / &gt;G. (Thank you!!!) If you have a question that the rulebook doesn’t answer (or which it does answer, but still seems ambiguous to you), and you don’t see a relevant FAQ entry, please post your question in a new thread here on this forum, or on <a href=\"https://www.boardgamegeek.com/boardgame/162886/spirit-island\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the BoardGameGeek Spirit Island</a> forums.</p>\n<p>This thread is for commenting / discussion on the FAQ site itself. If you note a bug, or have a question about how the FAQ works, feel free to mention it here! - though if it’s a critical problem, I’m on BGG slightly more often, so <a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1813253/living-faq-errata\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the equivalent thread there</a> will on average catch my attention slightly faster.</p>\n<p>(Mentioning feature requests here is OK - just be aware they’re not super-likely to be implemented, and if they are it’s not likely to be quickly. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
